{"h":3395,"w":2400,"lines":[{"w":0.069958845774332645,"h":0.008720930389296444,"t":"1718867188","c":0.5,"x":0.7716049391467531,"y":0.046511627815394085},{"h":0.014196644121401425,"w":0.11360797882080076,"x":0.11498440172267685,"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.053835978121185457,"c":1},{"h":0.0087209298276508251,"c":1,"y":0.098837209432104833,"t":"FRANK:","w":0.047325102488199877,"x":0.1172839510021278},{"w":0.039094648361206075,"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.11728395151150323,"t":"JANE:","y":0.11337209290524608,"c":1},{"h":0.0088486598433819008,"c":1,"x":0.1172605268798626,"t":"FRANK:","w":0.047371950149536129,"y":0.14237799564102382},{"t":"JANE:","x":0.11728394984722371,"y":0.1569767440847275,"w":0.039094651540120456,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1},{"t":"FRANK:","y":0.18454089287018816,"w":0.047369810740152993,"h":0.010278679316400474,"c":1,"x":0.11726159660873146},{"x":0.11728394984722371,"y":0.20058139526440477,"t":"JANE.","h":0.0072674419910803145,"c":1,"w":0.039094651540120456},{"t":"FRANK:","c":1,"y":0.24263059911954798,"x":0.11724223880153564,"h":0.01037833659752796,"w":0.049466139475504545},{"c":1,"w":0.039094648361206047,"t":"JANE:","x":0.11728395142296349,"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.25726744175302618},{"t":"FRANK:","x":0.11728395071063259,"y":0.30087209292592809,"c":1,"w":0.047325102488199863,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"t":"JANE:","y":0.31395348842919779,"h":0.0087209298276508251,"x":0.11728395143668092,"c":1,"w":0.039094648361206061},{"t":"FRANK:","h":0.0087857409276165255,"c":1,"x":0.11727202697337238,"w":0.047348950703938797,"y":0.34299085037958155},{"x":0.11728395146240109,"h":0.0087209298276508251,"c":1,"w":0.039094648361206047,"t":"JANE:","y":0.35755813962832572},{"y":0.41563380959451213,"x":0.1172605268798626,"c":1,"h":0.0088486598433819008,"w":0.047371950149536129,"t":"FRANK:"},{"h":0.0072674419910803145,"w":0.039094651540120429,"t":"JANE:","x":0.11728394984079368,"y":0.4302325580515165,"c":1},{"x":0.11728395071063259,"w":0.047325102488199863,"c":1,"t":"FRANK:","y":0.44476744176313743,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"x":0.20987653651369195,"c":1,"t":"So next month, on the 19th of October, we're holding a quiz - a couple of","h":0.011778563015312216,"y":0.11189634877387822,"w":0.54320988972981765},{"t":"residents are great at planning unusual ones, and we always fill the village hall.","w":0.5864197285970052,"h":0.011778563015312105,"x":0.20781894218599367,"c":1,"y":0.1263250882064777},{"t":"That sounds like fun. Can I do anything to help?","w":0.35596707661946619,"x":0.20781893072378693,"y":0.13953488359957378,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"t":"Well, because of the number of people, we need plenty of refreshments for","w":0.5576131693522135,"x":0.20781892962195769,"c":1,"h":0.011778563015312105,"y":0.15547703170847882},{"t":"halfway through. So, if you could provide any, we'd be grateful.","y":0.16860465100889976,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.46502054850260421,"c":1,"x":0.20781894329556574},{"h":0.011627907185728703,"y":0.18459302314874915,"x":0.20781891737823183,"t":"I'm sure I could. I'll think about what to make, and let you know.","w":0.47119344075520836,"c":1},{"y":0.19758539484059512,"t":"Thank you. Then on November the 18th, we're holding a dance, also in the","x":0.20987655189531912,"w":0.5534979248046874,"c":1,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"t":"village hall. We've booked a band that specialises in music of the 1930s - they've","y":0.2122093022182252,"w":0.60288065592447926,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.20781893119515266},{"x":0.20781892461414306,"w":0.47942387898763017,"c":1,"t":"been before, and we've had a lot of requests to bring them back.","h":0.01308824372937456,"y":0.22673733778027394},{"t":"I'm not really a dancer, but I'd like to do something to help.","w":0.43415639241536463,"y":0.241166077787898,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"x":0.20781892302796004},{"t":"Well, we sell tickets in advance, and having an extra person to check them at the","y":0.25581395338183999,"w":0.59670781453450517,"x":0.20987654530295885,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"x":0.20781893400609552,"y":0.27031802127713456,"w":0.58436213175455731,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"t":"door, as people arrive, would be good - it can be quite a bottleneck if everyone"},{"y":0.28474676072783422,"w":0.11728394826253255,"h":0.010311378887881917,"t":"arrives at once!","c":1,"x":0.20781893113493741},{"y":0.29941860452600366,"w":0.17901234944661457,"x":0.2078189280532742,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"Ok, I'm happy with that.","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.31242638386051524,"t":"We're also arranging a New Year's Eve party. We're expecting that to be a really","w":0.59465021769205739,"x":0.20781892393844609,"h":0.013250883392226243},{"x":0.20781892338424948,"w":0.54320988972981776,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.32703488359941235,"t":"big event, so instead of the village hall, it'll be held in the Mountfort Hotel."},{"t":"Mountfort. M-O-U-N-T-F-O-R-T Hotel. It isn't in Southoe itself, but it's only a","x":0.20781893778432523,"c":1,"y":0.35600706735737764,"w":0.55967076619466138,"h":0.013250883392226021},{"w":0.56378601074218748,"x":0.20781892868569646,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"couple of miles away. The hotel will be providing dinner and we've booked a","y":0.37063953477690315,"c":1},{"h":0.01309680320910489,"y":0.38515901085913007,"x":0.20781892051485054,"w":0.5617284138997396,"t":"band. The one thing we haven't got yet is a poster. That isn't something you","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"could do, by any chance, is it?","y":0.39958775030127403,"x":0.20781892508837899,"w":0.22633745829264321,"h":0.011778563015312105},{"w":0.59876541137695316,"x":0.20781894029917775,"y":0.41424418594000767,"t":"Well actually, yes. Before I retired I was a graphic designer, so that's right up my street.","h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"h":0.013250883392226243,"c":1,"x":0.20987656037815347,"y":0.42726737322773189,"t":"Oh perfect! I'Il give you the details, and then perhaps you could send me a draft ...","w":0.59465016682942706},{"y":0.48735572318146492,"h":0.016567623376565477,"t":"PART 2","x":0.11699839401097312,"c":1,"w":0.097278931935628254},{"w":0.69135803222656256,"h":0.011778563015312105,"t":"Good morning, and welcome to Oniton Hall, one of the largest estates in the area. My name's","x":0.11934155990424604,"c":1,"y":0.51442873988774873},{"c":1,"x":0.11934156555685642,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Nick, and I'm one of the guides. I'll give you a brief introduction to the estate while you're","w":0.65432098388671878,"y":0.52906976732201971},{"y":0.54505300373834031,"h":0.011778563015312105,"w":0.29423868815104165,"c":1,"x":0.1172839480004319,"t":"sitting down, and then we ll walk round."},{"y":0.5653710245763125,"h":0.011778563015312105,"w":0.63786010742187504,"c":1,"x":0.11934155112137716,"t":"The estate consists of the house, gardens, parkland and farm, and it dates back to the"},{"y":0.57979976457063853,"c":1,"h":0.011778563015312105,"w":0.6748971048990885,"x":0.11728395773595546,"t":"fourteenth century. The original house was replaced in the late seventeenth century, and of"},{"y":0.59447674407963547,"w":0.69135803222656245,"x":0.11728394675393133,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"course it has had a large number of owners. Almost all of them have left their mark, generally"},{"w":0.69135803222656245,"x":0.11728394674780636,"y":0.60895170807260468,"t":"by adding new rooms, like the ballroom and conservatory, or by demolishing others. The farm","h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1},{"t":"looks much as it's always done, although the current owner has done a great deal of work to","x":0.1172839395265558,"w":0.68312759399414058,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.62354651152154539},{"y":0.65842167239472993,"t":"In the seventeenth century, the estate was owned by a very wealthy man called Sir Edward","w":0.6748971048990885,"h":0.013089955625320671,"c":1,"x":0.11728395786248011},{"t":"Downes. His intention was to escape from the world of politics, after years as an active","x":0.11934155925461709,"y":0.67285041239058718,"w":0.63991770426432293,"h":0.013250883392226243,"c":1},{"y":0.68749999987745336,"x":0.11728394608902411,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"politician, and to build a new house worthy of his big collection of books, paintings and","w":0.63991770426432282},{"t":"sculptures. He broke off contact with his former political allies, and hosted meetings of","x":0.11728394613505079,"w":0.63991770426432293,"h":0.011778563015312105,"y":0.70200235590634852,"c":1},{"w":0.65637858072916666,"x":0.11934157372560994,"y":0.71643109532562987,"t":"creative and literary people, like painters and poets. Unusually for his time, he didn't care","h":0.013250883392226243,"c":1},{"w":0.47530863444010413,"y":0.73110465105567968,"x":0.11728395428432274,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"whether his guests were rich or poor, as long as they had talent.","c":1},{"t":"Q11","w":0.034979422887166489,"x":0.83333333372837448,"y":0.59302325564968061,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166489,"t":"Q12","x":0.83539094688332005,"y":0.70203488358010091},{"h":0.013093378855567162,"t":"Big houses like Oniton had dozens of servants until the 1920s or 30s, and we've tried to","w":0.65020573933919279,"y":0.77179034141255032,"c":1,"x":0.11934156681874412},{"h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.11728395703613946,"t":"show what their working lives were like. Photographs of course don't give much of an idea, so","y":0.7862190814067227,"w":0.69341562906901044,"c":1},{"t":"instead, as you go round the house, you'll see volunteers dressed up as nineteenth-century.","x":0.11728395664102682,"w":0.68106994628906248,"y":0.80087209289548222,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.11728394675546468,"t":"servants, going about their work. They'll explain what they're doing, and tell you their recipes,","w":0.69135803222656245,"y":0.81537102456173993,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"t":"or what tools they're using. We've just introduced this feature to replace the audio guide we","x":0.1172839404667665,"y":0.82979976455713778,"w":0.67695475260416671,"c":1,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"y":0.84326309735412508,"w":0.1752290598551432,"c":1,"x":0.11715408001430144,"h":0.012933533379832163,"t":"used to have available."},{"y":0.86773255798110183,"w":0.03497942288716635,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"102","x":0.11728395099854647,"c":1},{"y":0.80087209286482275,"w":0.037037035624186254,"t":"Q13","h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"x":0.83333333393687814},{"h":0.035152653221247165,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","w":0.30619837443033859,"y":0.95314993691982619,"c":1,"x":0.66984496081179823}]}